From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tompta1 <546706+tompta1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:39:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: regulator: describe the August touch analog
 supply

Add the J120 analog LDO compatible to the existing Apple PMIC touch regulator binding.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml         | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
index f02ee8ccb..df5ab7032 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/regulator/apple,pmic-touch-regulator.yaml
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@ maintainers:
 
 description:
   Fixed touchscreen supply switches provided by the D2089, D2186, D2207, Adelyn,
-  Angel, Chestnut and Acorn PMICs. The compatible identifies both the PMIC and the physical supply;
+  Angel, August, Chestnut and Acorn PMICs. The compatible identifies both the PMIC and the physical supply;
   register layout is an implementation detail of the regulator driver.
 
 allOf:
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ properties:
       - apple,acorn-touch-analog-regulator
       - apple,adelyn-touch-core-regulator
       - apple,angel-touch-analog-regulator
+      - apple,august-touch-analog-regulator
       - apple,chestnut-touch-hv-regulator
       - apple,d2089-touch-analog-regulator
       - apple,d2089-touch-core-regulator
